       RROORR__NNOOTT__AACCTTIIVVAATTEEDD if called on a capture handle that has  been  created
       but not activated, and PPCCAAPP__EERRRROORR on other errors.

       ppccaapp__sseennddppaacckkeett()  returns  00  on  success, PPCCAAPP__EERRRROORR__NNOOTT__AACCTTIIVVAATTEEDD if
       called on a capture handle that has been created but not activated, and
       PPCCAAPP__EERRRROORR on other errors.

